      "langue": "en",
      "text": "The climate is a bit dark , the earth has collapsed and you start trapped by chains, waking up with a headache . You have no idea what that place is.\r\n\r\nAlready in the first steps someone, from afar, catches your attention and says “Ah! You finally woke up” . You already know what to do here, don't you? Go up the stairs to talk to him, he seems to be a knight, just like you."
